~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

Phone: Boss is calling again...
- Answer
	Boss: You arrived?.
	Boss: Good. Three crates ahead, the one in the center holds my blade. You’ll need it for
	Boss: Don’t look for me. I had business elsewhere. Finish this quietly. Leave no echoes.
	Boss: Once you get the blade, Get in the car to go to the target's location.
	set State.finished_sec_dialogue = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	=> END
- Decline
	set State.rang = true
	=> start

set State.finished_sec_dialogue = true
set State.in_dialogue = false
=> END
